OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FShowers continuing through the
OL,6,Fmorning these once again often heavy
OL,7,Fand the odd rumble of thunder. Showers
OL,8,Fmove eastwards through late afternoon,
OL,9,Fleaving some sunny spells. Feeling
OL,10,Fwarm.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FBright end to the afternoon
OL,13,Fwith sunny spells giving way to clear
OL,14,Fspells overnight. Turning increasing
OL,15,Fcloudy from the west from midnight
OL,16,Fwith outbreaks of heavy and thundery
OL,17,Frain arriving.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
